						</span>
					</div>
					<div class="card-body">
						<div class="card-text">
														<div class="row">
								<div class="col-md-12 mb-3">
									<div class="card border-0 bg-color-grey h-100">
										<div class="card-body">
											<h6 class="card-title mb-1 text-5 text-primary font-weight-bold alt-font2 positive-ls-1">
												Fremont County Clerk &amp; Recorder&apos;s Self-Service Website											</h6>
											<p class="mb-0 text-3-4">
												Search public records, apply for marriage licenses, receive fraud notifications, and submit documents online												<a class="mt-3 btn btn-sm btn-tertiary btn-outline font-weight-semi-bold float-end" 
													href="https://fremontcountyco-web.tylerhost.net/web/" 
													title="Visit this website for Fremont County Clerk &amp; Recorder&apos;s Self-Service Website"
													 target="_blank" rel="noopener">
